      "message": "Is the intent here to store the validation states and compilation messages in the cache? Overall the approach seems too complicated, esp with WithMaybeError etc.\n\nWDYT of doing:\n\n - Change ValidateAndParse, to ValidateShaderModuleDescriptor (without parsing) just to check the members are correctly set etc.\n - Use that to call `ParseWGSL` that returns a `ShaderModuleParseResult` which contains the eventual tint::Program if not loaded from the cache, diagnostics and has a method that is \"HasErrors()\" or something.\n - Make `ParseWGSL` load from the cache if needed.\n - Use the result of `ParseWGSL` to generate an error or / and new ShaderModule in the device.",
      "revId": "5e5adaa03a3a290cf3194922fe18705b397e1a5c",
